---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="Customs & Liability">
  <h1>Customs & liability</h1>
  <p class="legal-notice">This policy is pending final legal review.</p>

  <section>
    <h2>Customs responsibility</h2>
    <p>Customs authorities may inspect and hold items in a traveller's baggage. The traveller (passenger) is ultimately responsible for the contents of their own baggage at all customs checkpoints.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Sender responsibility</h2>
    <p>Senders must declare parcel contents accurately, send only permitted and non-dutiable items, and comply with all applicable export and import regulations.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Khepia's role</h2>
    <p>Khepia provides a matching platform, training materials, and tracking. Khepia does not guarantee customs clearance and is not a customs agent or broker.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Liability limitations</h2>
    <p>Specific liability limitations are pending final legal review and will be detailed here.</p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
